# Tool output, not source. `.playwright-mcp/` is the browser-MCP session log
# (console-*.log, page-*.yml) and `graphify-out/` is the knowledge graph the
# graphify skill writes. Both were tracked once: a tracked file is unaffected by
# .gitignore, so the rule below only bites after `git rm --cached`.
.playwright-mcp/
graphify-out/
